   "h": "Low back pain — แผนผังแยกโรค (mechanical / non-mechanical / referred)",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y82a\"></div><ul><li><b>Mechanical LBP (97%)</b>: Lumbar sprain/strain · Lumbar disc (Degeneration, Herniated disc) · Bone (Osteoporotic compression Fx, Spondylolisthesis, Traumatic Fx, severe Kyphosis/scoliosis)</li><li><b>Non-mechanical spinal condition (1%)</b> — Neoplasm: Multiple myeloma, Metastatic CA, Lymphoma/leukemia, Cord tumor, 1<sup>0</sup> vertebral tumor · Infection: Osteomyelitis, Septic diskitis, Paraspinous abscess, Epidural abscess · Inflammatory arthritis: Ankylosing spondylitis, Psoriatic spondylitits, Reiter syndrome, Inflammatory bowel dz</li><li><b>Referred pain (2%)</b> — Pelvic organ: Prostatitis, Endometritis, Chronic PID · Renal disease: Nephrolithiasis, Pyelonephritis, Perinephric abscess · AAA · GI disease: Pancreatitis, Penetrating ulcer</li></ul>"
  }
